sequenceDiagram
  actor C as Authenticated client session
  participant D as DM Help service
  participant S as Local SQL/player-help spool
  participant P as Python bridge
  participant L as Configured Ollama endpoint
  C->>D: Help question / token-bound follow-up
  D->>D: availability, bounded question/context, account and global rate limits
  alt unavailable or rate limited
    D-->>C: bounded rejection
  else slot admitted
    D->>S: request JSON then id ready marker
    P->>S: read bounded marker and matching request
    P->>P: validate conversation, rate limit, retrieve approved gameplay corpus
    P->>L: bounded HTTP POST via deadline child (no redirects/proxy)
    L-->>P: model text or transport failure
    P->>S: atomic response only if ready id still matches
    loop scheduled DM poll
      D->>S: bounded response with matching id
      alt client gone or conversation generation changed
        D->>D: discard client delivery eligibility
      else usable response
        D-->>C: escaped plain/basic Markdown answer
        D->>D: remember bounded session turns; rotate action token
      else deadline / unusable / model rate limit
        D-->>C: bounded unavailable, timeout or retry message
      end
    end
    D->>S: clear slot
  end
  Note over C,L: Help is informational; model receives no gameplay tools or actions
